# Allow-list: the build context is only what the image needs. Secrets (.env),
# caches (.cache/ holds GBs of weights), the index (qdrant_storage/), private
# notes and git metadata can never leak into a layer. To ship a new file, add
# it here explicitly.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
